# Fixture repositories are task content: everything under here is committed, including what
# a normal project ignores (build output, packaging metadata, coverage). The repository's own
# .gitignore would otherwise keep it out of every commit, and a clean checkout would silently
# lack it (flagkit-dist-build's dist/ did). Caches stay ignored. The harness refuses any task
# content git does not track (suite.assert_committed).
!dist/
!build/
!*.egg-info/
!htmlcov/
!.coverage
